# === Archived dead code (2026-06 cleanup) ===
# archive/ contains stubs that the repo no longer uses. The directory tree is
# tracked (so git history is preserved), but its build outputs and caches are
# excluded. See archive/DEAD_CODE_QUARANTINE.md for the manifest.
